# Hexagonal

- Ports: `application/ports` (`Protocol`)
- Adapters: `infrastructure/adapters`
- Use cases dependem so de ports + domain
- Composition root apenas em `presentation/cli/bootstrap.py`
- Imports limpos: `from domain...`, `from application...`
- Docs: `docs/arquitetura.md`, `docs/structure.md`
